('en_US', 68, 'পৌর শহ‌রের ব‌র্জ্যে দু‌ষিত হ‌চ্ছে কাপ্তাই হ্রদ, হুম‌কির মু‌খে জীববৈচিত্র্য', 'একটি নাম, যা দেশের ভ্রমণপিপাসু মানুষের মনে এক অপার ভালোলাগার প্রতিচ্ছবি। কাপ্তাই লেকের নীল জলরাশি, সবুজ পাহাড়, জনজাতি সংস্কৃতি—', '<p><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:18.0pt;line-height:115%;\">একটি</span><span style=\"font-family:SutonnyMJ;font-size:18.0pt;line-height:115%;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:18.0pt;line-height:115%;\">নাম</span><span style=\"font-family:SutonnyMJ;font-size:18.0pt;line-height:115%;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:18.0pt;line-height:115%;\">যা</span><span style=\"font-family:SutonnyMJ;font-size:18.0pt;line-height:115%;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:18.0pt;line-height:115%;\">দেশের</span><span style=\"font-family:SutonnyMJ;font-size:18.0pt;line-height:115%;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:18.0pt;line-height:115%;\">ভ্রমণপিপাসু</span><span style=\"font-family:SutonnyMJ;font-size:18.0pt;line-height:115%;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:18.0pt;line-height:115%;\">মানুষের</span><span style=\"font-family:SutonnyMJ;font-size:18.0pt;line-height:115%;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:18.0pt;line-height:115%;\">মনে</span><span style=\"font-family:SutonnyMJ;font-size:18.0pt;line-height:115%;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:18.0pt;line-height:115%;\">এক</span><span style=\"font-family:SutonnyMJ;font-size:18.0pt;line-height:115%;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:18.0pt;line-height:115%;\">অপার</span><span style=\"font-family:SutonnyMJ;font-size:18.0pt;line-height:115%;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-fa